          "_sourceTheme": "mobirise5",
          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"header14\" group=\"Headers\" data-bg-video=\"{{bg.type == 'video' && bg.value.url}}\" mbr-class=\"{\n    'mbr-fullscreen': fullScreen,\n    'mbr-parallax-background': bg.parallax}\">\n\n    <mbr-parameters>\n        <header>Size</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Screen\" name=\"fullScreen\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Width\" name=\"fullWidth\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"3\" condition=\"fullScreen == false\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"3\" condition=\"fullScreen == false\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline name=\"imageWidth\" title=\"Image\" min=\"4\" max=\"8\" step=\"1\" value=\"4\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Reverse\" name=\"reverseContent\">\n        <header>Show/Hide</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Remove Padding\" name=\"imageFullWidth\" condition=\"fullWidth\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showTitle\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Text\" name=\"showText\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Buttons\" name=\"showButtons\" checked>\n        <header>Background</header>\n        <fieldset type=\"background\" name=\"bg\" parallax>\n            <input type=\"image\" title=\"Image\" value=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/background7.jpg\" parallax>\n            <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" value=\"#ffffff\" selected>\n            <input type=\"video\" title=\"Video\" value=\"https://vimeo.com/428046504\">\n        </fieldset>\n        <header condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">Fallback Image</header>\n        <input type=\"image\" title=\"Fallback Image\" value=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/background13.jpg\" name=\"fallBackImage\" condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Overlay\" name=\"overlay\" condition=\"bg.type !== 'color'\" checked>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Overlay Color\" name=\"overlayColor\" value=\"#ffffff\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Opacity\" name=\"overlayOpacity\" min=\"0\" max=\"1\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"0.8\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n    </mbr-parameters>\n\n    <div class=\"mbr-fallback-image disabled\" mbr-if=\"bg.type == 'video'\"></div>\n    <div class=\"mbr-overlay\" mbr-if=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\" opacity=\"{{overlayOpacity}}\" bg-color=\"{{overlayColor}}\"></div>\n\n    <div mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth, 'container-fluid': fullWidth}\">\n        <div class=\"row justify-content-center align-items-center\">\n            <div class=\"col-12 col-md-{{imageWidth}} image-wrapper\">\n                <img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/c9db433c-87c6-4115-aebf-2767e277d3fe-793x1983.webp\" alt=\"How-Do-Hume-Health-Work?\">\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"col-12 col-md\">\n                <div class=\"text-wrapper\">\n                    <h1 class=\"mbr-section-title mbr-fonts-style mb-3\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-title\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-2\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\">\n                        <b>Intro with Image</b></h1>\n                    <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showText\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text, .mbr-section-btn\">The Hume Band is marketed as a next-generation wearable designed to track markers of wellness and longevity. Unlike basic fitness trackers that only log steps or calories burned, this device positions itself within the growing field of biohacking and preventative health technology. Its purpose is not only to monitor day-to-day activity but also to provide users with deeper insights into how their body responds to lifestyle choices, environmental factors, and long-term health strategies.\n<br>\n<br>At its core, the Hume Band functions as a wrist-worn device equipped with sensors that monitor vital data points. While exact specifications vary depending on updates and models, most descriptions highlight capabilities such as heart rate monitoring, sleep tracking, and biometric trend analysis. These features place the band in direct competition with mainstream wearables like Apple Watch or Fitbit, but the company differentiates itself by emphasizing longevity insights rather than purely fitness or lifestyle metrics.\n<br>\n<br>For example, the Hume Band is positioned as a tool for individuals who are curious about their biological rhythms and who want to see whether their habits - from diet and exercise to stress management and recovery - are moving them in the right direction over time. This framing appeals to a growing audience of consumers who want personal data ownership and a more proactive role in shaping their health journey.\n<br>\n<br>Equally important, the Hume Band emphasizes responsible use. The company is careful to clarify that the device is not a medical diagnostic tool. Instead, it should be seen as a complement to professional care and a way to gain awareness about personal wellness trends. This aligns with broader industry practices, where disclaimers are necessary to separate consumer-grade wearables from FDA-regulated medical devices.\n<br>\n<br>In practice, using the Hume Band typically involves syncing it with a mobile app. The app interface provides dashboards where users can view their daily stats, monitor trends, and receive recommendations on how to adjust their routines. Like other modern wearables, the success of the product depends not only on the accuracy of its hardware but also on the quality and usability of its software ecosystem. Complaints often surface when apps are buggy, difficult to navigate, or incompatible with certain smartphones - and this is an area we'll explore in depth later in the complaints section.\n<br>\n<br>For consumers exploring whether this product is right for them, the key takeaway is this: the Hume Band is designed to be a lifestyle technology that blends fitness, biohacking, and wellness monitoring. It offers intriguing potential for those curious about longevity science, but as with any emerging gadget, user experience may vary, and expectations should be managed accordingly.<br></p>\n                    <div mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" class=\"mbr-section-btn mt-3\" mbr-if=\"showButtons\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnMove\"><a class=\"btn btn-secondary\" href=\"https://www.oobots.com/27P16DG7/5HLBCX2/\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\"><span class=\"mobi-mbri mobi-mbri-shopping-cart mbr-iconfont mbr-iconfont-btn\"></span>Buy&nbsp;Hume Health Today</a></div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>",
